COMPILATION OF: E48A12

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48A12

   1 a 0000 E48A12:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1] THE COMBINATION CREATE USES: store the condition
   4 a 0006      result, then test its negation, in one loop.  If P1 and P6
   5 a 0006      both hold, this object should carry BOTH shapes and nothing
   6 a 0006      new; if DR emits something else for the pair, the two shapes
   7 a 0006      are not independent. */
   8 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   9 c 0006   dcl name char(30) varying;
  10 c 0006   dcl n fixed bin(15);
  11 c 0006   n = 0;
  12 c 000C   do while(^b);
  13 c 0013      n = n + 1;
  14 c 001A      name = 'AB';
  15 c 0027      b = (name = 'EOF');
  16 c 0038      if n = 4 then b = '1'b;
  17 c 004C   end;
  18 c 004C   put list('N=', n);
  19 c 006E   stop;
  20 a 0071 end E48A12;

CODE SIZE = 0071
DATA AREA = 0029
FREE SYMS = 384C
END  COMPILATION
